  "reason": "Retain exactly 48 source files in the database lifecycle module. Durable pending-audit state and cleanup waits extend the existing integrity authority; upgrade selection, resource admission, recovery and atomic publication remain under the same store owner. The migration package owns frozen route and sorter facts, while fileclone/fseffect own filesystem primitives. Splitting these private phases behind forwarding services would spread transaction and restart custody. Joined contracts cover primary selection, the three-sorter envelope, strategy equivalence, original/recovery custody, operational failure, deferred-audit restart and typed quarantine. Further membership growth renews review.",
